OL,3,AMike Ashley attacks Burnham plans as
OL,4,A'populist'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBillionaire Sports Direct founder Mike
OL,7,FAshley has criticised recent cost of
OL,8,Fliving and retail policies from Andy
OL,9,FBurnham as "populist reactions".
OL,11,FIn a letter to the prime minister, the
OL,12,Fentrepreneur accused him of "jumping on
OL,13,F'everyday fixes' or bandwagons", while
OL,14,F"disastrous" business rates policies
OL,15,Fand increases to the cost of employing
OL,16,Fworkers were causing businesses to
OL,17,Fstruggle.
OL,19,FHe also described a previous proposal
OL,20,Fof increasing business rates on large
OL,21,Fwarehouses to help reduce them for pubs
OL,22,Fand clubs as "delusional".
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
