OL,3,AMike Ashley attacks Burnham plans as
OL,4,A'populist'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Downing Street spokesperson said
OL,7,FBurnham would "build a new economy that
OL,8,Fbacks British business, delivers growth
OL,9,Fin every postcode and ensures the
OL,10,Fessentials in life - like energy, water
OL,11,Fand housing - are affordable again."
